---
description: Jupyter Notebooks boundaries
globs:
  - "src/notebooks/*.ipynb"
alwaysApply false
---

## Notebook role

- **Notebooks under `src/notebooks/` are the R&D path and the regression baseline; production-facing behavior must live in `src/modules/` and `run_ablation.py`, not only in notebook cells.**
- **Notebooks are not an application entry point; do not wire the planned web workflow or model-upload flow to execute notebook cells directly.**

## Logic extraction

- **When extracting logic from a notebook into `src/modules/`, document in the module docstring or PR description: inputs, outputs, configuration keys, side effects (files written, API calls), and hidden dependencies (cell order, global state, newest-file `glob` selection).**
